Bundled data
------------

Sources/WordNetKit/Resources/wordnet.sqlite is generated from:

    Open English WordNet 2025
    https://github.com/globalwordnet/english-wordnet
    Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

CC BY 4.0 requires attribution. Any application shipping this package must
credit Open English WordNet somewhere visible to users — an about screen,
settings pane, or acknowledgements list is customary.

The package provides the credit line for you:

    let metadata = try await WordNet.shared.metadata()
    print(metadata.attribution)
    // Open English Wordnet 2025, licensed under CC BY 4.0

Open English WordNet derives from Princeton WordNet 3.0:

    Princeton University "About WordNet." WordNet. Princeton University. 2010.
    https://wordnet.princeton.edu/

No changes were made to the meaning of the data. It was converted from the
WN-LMF XML distribution into SQLite by Tools/build_db.py.
